   "width": 510.4,
   "height": 41.25,
   "text": "2LDs trade as plain ERC-721. Subnames are registry entries (parent-revocable —\nthe right semantic for org delegation; revisit wrapper only if trustless subname\nsales become a requirement). Subgraph: optional (history only), per #20.",
